	(gr_text "FABRICATION NOTES\n \n  1. BOARD VIEW FROM PRIMARY (FRONT/TOP) SIDE. \n \n  2. ALL DIMENSIONS ARE IN MILLIMETERS UNLESS OTHERWISE NOTED.\n     BOARD DIMENSIONS: 166.0mm x 130.0mm.\n     BOARD OUTLINE AND CUTOUT TOLERANCE SHALL BE +/- 0.25mm.\n \n  3. FABRICATE BOARD PER IPC-6012, TYPE 3, CLASS 2.\n     USE THE PROVIDED GERBER FILES AND NC DRILL DATA.\n     PDF FILES INCLUDED ARE FOR REFERENCE ONLY.\n     USE SUPPLIED IPC-356 NETLIST TO COMPARE WITH GERBER DATA PRIOR TO MANUFACTURING.\n \n  4. STACKUP:\n       INSULATED METAL SUBSTRATE, ALUMINUM, DESIRED FINAL THICKNESS 1.6mm (+/- 10%)\n         \n         PRIMARY   (F)      - 1 Oz. COPPER* (1/2oz base)\n         ------------------ - DIELECTRIC\n         ------------------ - ALUMINUM CORE 1.5mm NOMINAL\n       \n       * 0.5 Oz. COPPER DEFINED AS 17.5um NOMINAL, 15um MINIMUM FINISHED COPPER THICKNESS.\n       * 1 Oz. COPPER DEFINED AS 35um NOMINAL, 25um MINIMUM FINISHED COPPER THICKNESS.\n       * 2 Oz. COPPER DEFINED AS 70um NOMINAL, 55um MINIMUM FINISHED COPPER THICKNESS.\n       \n  5. CONTROLLED IMPEDANCE REQUIREMENTS:\n       NONE\n  \n  6. BOARD SURFACE FINISH:\n       HASL LEAD-FREE\n\n  7. SOLDER MASK:\n       WHITE COLOR\n       APPLY SOLDER MASK OVER BARE COPPER.\n\n  8. SILKSCREEN:\n       BLACK NON-CONDUCTIVE INK\n       SILKSCREEN IS NOT PERMITTED ON ANY EXPOSED COPPER FEATURES.\n       OVERLAP ONTO NON-COMPONENT HOLES IS ALLOWED.\n       MINIMUM SILKSCREEN TEXT HEIGHT, AS DESIGNED, IS 1.0mm.\n       MINIMUM SILKSCREEN LINE THICKNESS, AS DESIGNED, IS 0.15mm.\n\n  9. MINIMUM ANNULAR RING SHALL BE IN ACCORDANCE WITH IPC-6012 CLASS 2.\n\n  10. MINIMUM TRACE WIDTH, AS DESIGNED, IS 0.2mm.\n      MINIMUM CLEARANCE, AS DESIGNED, IS 0.2mm."
		(at 163 143 0)
